}


### Obtener permisos
GET {{host}}/api/permissions
Authorization: Bearer 


### Asignar rol a un usuario
POST {{host}}/api/userroles
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "5194dde2-7284-401b-b24f-ea522d6b2b4a",
  "roleId": 1
}

###

### Obtener roles de un usuario
GET {{host}}/api/userroles/5194dde2-7284-401b-b24f-ea522d6b2b4a
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN

###

### Eliminar rol de un usuario
DELETE {{host}}/api/userroles/5194dde2-7284-401b-b24f-ea522d6b2b4a/1
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN